  "title": "Anthropic Launches Claude Voice Mode with Enhanced Capabilities and Pricing Strategy",
  "summary": "Anthropic has introduced Claude's voice mode with support for Opus and Sonnet, allowing users to control the chatbot's tone. The company also plans to expand pricing strategies in India, while its pricing shift aims to compete with rivals in the AI market.",
